ADDITIONAL NOTICE — MEDICAL DISCLAIMER

This software is a clinical decision-support tool intended for research and
educational purposes. It is NOT a medical device, has NOT undergone prospective
clinical validation, and has NOT been approved or cleared by any regulatory
authority.

Outputs must not be used as the sole basis for any diagnosis or treatment
decision. All predictions require review and confirmation by a qualified
clinician exercising independent professional judgement in accordance with
established medical guidelines.

